":ref:`Bank synchronization troubleshooting <accounting/bank-synchronization/"
"troubleshooting>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`פתרון בעיות סנכרון בנק <accounting/bank-synchronization/"
"troubleshooting>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:140
msgid ""
":ref:`Salt Edge bank synchronization troubleshooting <accounting/bank-"
"synchronization/troubleshooting-saltedge>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`פתרון בעיות סנכרון בנק Salt Edge <accounting/bank-synchronization/"
"troubleshooting-saltedge>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:142
msgid ""
":ref:`Ponto bank synchronization troubleshooting <accounting/bank-"
"synchronization/ponto/troubleshooting>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`פתרון בעיות סנכרון בנק Ponto <accounting/bank-synchronization/ponto/"
